<title>USA: GM September US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>GM September US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car		226,740	   262,553	    -10.0</p>
<p> Total Truck	    150,737	   138,910	    +13.0</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	  377,477	   401,463	     -2.1</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car	    2,201,368	 2,234,860	     -1.9</p>
<p> Total Truck	  1,506,544	 1,455,876	     +3.0</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	3,707,912	 3,690,736	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
